      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Jobhunter AI Agent – setup\n1. Create a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and select it in *Upsert Jobs to Google Sheet*.\n2. Replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` with your sheet ID. Row 1 needs the columns from `config/google-sheet-columns.csv`.\n3. Create an **SMTP** credential and select it in *Send Email Digest*. Replace the example addresses.\n4. Test manually, then publish/activate.",
